==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|manendach}}, {{m|dum|maendach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*mānendag}}, from late {{der|nl|gem-pro|*mēniniz dagaz||day of the moon}}.

Compare Low German {{m|nds|Maandag}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|moandei}}, German {{m|de|Montag}}, English {{m|en|Monday}}, Danish {{m|da|mandag}}.

